@Ordering_HostAddress = https://localhost:7029

### GetAllOrders
GET {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders
Accept: application/json

### GetProductByUserName
GET {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders/kietpham
Accept: application/json

### CreateProduct
POST {{Ordering_HostAddress}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
